   5  0000              ; Details", CPMREF = the CP/M 2.2 Reference Manual. See the consolidated fact sheet at
   6  0000              ; ../../docs/CPM_Manual_Reconcile_Facts.md. SCOPE: this is the 2.23 BIOS in the 60K config.
   7  0000              ; The SoftCard I/O facts (config block, I/O Vector Table, Card Type Table, RPC cells) are
