  70+ 0000              F_SIZE      EQU 35         ; [DOC CPMREF "COMPUTE FILE SIZE"] compute file size (DE -> FCB)
  71+ 0000              F_RANDREC   EQU 36         ; [DOC CPMREF "SET RANDOM RECORD"] set random record (DE -> FCB)
